      ],
      "text": "**Probably—but check the air-quality reading just before she leaves.** Singapore is hot today, around **32°C**, with showers expected from around midday. Keep the walk short and easy, choose a shaded route, and bring water. \n\nBecause she’s 70, check the **1-hour PM2.5** for her area in Singapore’s myENV app or haze.gov.sg: if it’s **151 µg/m³ or higher (Band 3)**, she should avoid outdoor activity; if it’s **56–150 (Band 2)**, avoid strenuous activity. If she has a heart or lung condition, feels unwell, or notices breathing discomfort, skip the walk and choose an indoor option. ([moh.gov.sg](https://www.moh.gov.sg/others/haze/))",
